  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Originally part of the GEL-1000 series, the ASICS GEL-1130 pays homage to its ninth iteration. Designed to keep you supported, these stability running shoes from 2008 embody decades of design evolution starting from their retro runner silhouette to this modern, street-savvy look. Rooted in the composition of the GEL-KAYANO 14 trainer, these shoes feature suede and mesh details with Gel technology and TRUSSTIC support system that preserve their late 2000s runner aesthetic and comfort. Following sustainability in their design, this pair also features a dope-dyed sockliner that helps achieve reduced water usage and carbon emissions.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-1130 features: </strong></p> <ul> <li>Suede overlays and mesh underlays give them a modernized look.</li> <li>GEL technology cushioning provides excellent shock absorption.</li> <li>TRUSSTIC support system improves stability while running.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for comfort that still feels easy to style. Inspired by late-2000s running design, the ASICS GEL-1130 brings together breathable support, everyday cushioning, and a clean retro runner look that moves effortlessly from daily errands to light workouts and travel.</p> <ul> <li>Layered mesh underlays and suede details create a breathable, heritage running-inspired upper.</li> <li>GEL technology cushioning helps absorb impact for a smooth, comfortable ride.</li> <li>TRUSSTIC support system adds stability through the midfoot.</li> <li>Dope-dyed sockliner helps reduce water usage and carbon emissions.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers say the fit feels true to size with a secure, comfortable feel. For the best fit, we recommend ordering your usual size, while shoppers between sizes or those who prefer a little extra room may want to try a half size up.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for everyday wear, travel, long hours on your feet, and light workouts when you want comfort and throwback running style in one pair.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p> <p>The GEL-1130 stands out with classic running lines that feel sporty, clean, and easy to pair with everything from leggings and denim to relaxed streetwear fits. Reviewers love how naturally it works for both casual outfits and more active days.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Many reviewers say this pair feels comfortable right away, with soft cushioning that works well for all-day wear and walking. For shoppers planning to keep them in heavy weekly rotation, alternating pairs and reserving them mainly for everyday use can help maintain that fresh underfoot feel over time.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-1130 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Sweet Pink/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203B119-100</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details cla